s, schools, and is minutes from Fort Cavazos. This location benefits from strong daily vehicle counts, steady local demand, and a loyal customer base drawn to Chevron's national brand. The property features brand-new fuel pumps, Chevron-branded canopy, a spacious retail storefront, ample parking, and convenient ingress/egress from both sides of the corner. Inside, the convenience store offers an open floorplan ideal for snacks, groceries, beverages, tobacco products, household essentials, and potential food-service expansion. The layout supports additional revenue streams, including lottery, hot food, beer/wine (subject to licensing), ATM, smoke shop products, and other high-margin categories. This site offers multiple value-add opportunities, including additional retail inventory, implementing a full food program, upgrading store layout, or enhancing fuel margins. Investors will appreciate the strong demographics and proximity to thousands of nearby rooftops, while operators will benefit from steady traffic generated by military personnel, commuters, and local residents. Located near Rancier Ave, Veterans Memorial Blvd, and WS Young Dr, the property enjoys continuous visibility and easy access for daily customers. Whether seeking a turnkey Chevron station with brand-new pumps or repositioning a high-traffic commercial corner, this asset provides exceptional potential in a fast-growing Central Texas market. Rare opportunity to secure a premium-branded fuel location in the heart of Killeen.\n\nLicense Number: 525615\n\nLicensed In: Texas", "channel_id": "UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "duration": 156, "view_count": 7, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MeYziIYsvHM", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["907 N Gray Street", "Killeen TX homes for sale", "Killeen TX real estate", "NextHome Southern Skies", "agent Asad Shaikh"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_stat